#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/command-line-tools.rst:7
msgid ""
"In self-managed deployments, a ``mattermost`` command is available for "
"configuring the system from the directory where the Mattermost server is "
"installed. For an overview of the Mattermost command line interface "
"(CLI), `read this article <https://medium.com/@santosjs/plugging-in-to-"
"the-mattermost-cli-8cdcef2bd1f6>`_ from Santos."
msgstr ""
"자체 관리 배포에서는 OKR.BEST 서버가 설치된 디렉토리에서 시스템을 구성하는 데 ``mattermost`` 명령을 사용할 수 있습니다. OKR.BEST "
"명령줄 인터페이스(CLI)의 개요는 Santos의 `이 문서 "
"<https://medium.com/@santosjs/plugging-in-to-the-mattermost-cli-8cdcef2bd1f6>`_ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/command-line-tools.rst:11
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v6.0, the majority of these CLI commands have been "
"replaced with equivalents available using the :doc:`mmctl command line "
"tool </administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool>`. However, "
":ref:`mattermost import <administration-guide/manage/command-line-"
"tools:mattermost import>` commands, :ref:`mattermost export "
"<administration-guide/manage/command-line-tools:mattermost export>` "
"commands, and related subcommands, remain available and fully supported "
"from Mattermost v6.0."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v6.0부터 이러한 CLI 명령의 대부분은 :doc:`mmctl 명령줄 도구 "
"</administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool>`\\ 로 사용할 수 있는 동등한 명령으로 대체되었습니다. "
"그러나 :ref:`mattermost import <administration-guide/manage/command-line-tools:mattermost "
"import>` 명령, :ref:`mattermost export "
"<administration-guide/manage/command-line-tools:mattermost export>` 명령 및 관련 하위 명령은 "
"OKR.BEST v6.0부터 계속 사용할 수 있으며 완전히 지원됩니다."

